<title>USA: HON Indus merging Heat-N-Glo, Heatilator.</title>
<headline>HON Indus merging Heat-N-Glo, Heatilator.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hon Industries Inc said Friday it is merging newly-acquired Heat-N-Glo Fireplace Products Inc with its Heatilator Inc subsidiary.</p>
<p>The combined operations will have about $180 million in sales.</p>
<p>The two companies will continue to operate as divisions of Hearth Technologies Inc, a subsidiary of Hon Industries.</p>
<p>Hon Industries manufactures metal and wood office furniture.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
